  · simpa only [show rowA45 1 = cellA45B1 from rfl] using cellA45B1_check
  · simpa only [show rowA45 2 = cellA45B2 from rfl] using cellA45B2_check
  · simpa only [show rowA45 3 = cellA45B3 from rfl] using cellA45B3_check
